Z||000004||Oreif||03-23-2001||10:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Philphine:<BR><B>what i'd like to find out is if the scoop did anything intake wise and how it was rigged up. like if it had ram air or something.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>The scoop was hooked to the air cleaner. If you look at any 2.5L 4-cyl the air cleaner is right under where the scoop goes.<P>||||reg||1
